    "body": "I tried to proxy a websocket connection. \nOpen page( 1-th instance) : connection is established\nopen page (2-th or more instances) :  it uses the same connection. \nAll seams work correctly but this test doesnt work\n\nOpen page( 1-th instance) : connection is established\nReload the same istance(same page): it doesnt use the same connection , but creates another connection. Pratically when you navigate from a page to another ... it seams to recreate new connections. Shared workker seams be used just you have multiple instances active but not if you pass to instance to another.\n",
